.DS_Store
# Test material that lives beside the code it tests: vitest snapshots and
# fixture directories. The runtime image never needs them, and the image
# inventory (scripts/check-image-inventory.mjs) rejects their file classes.
**/__snapshots__
**/fixtures
**/*.snap
# Build inputs of other images (the MCP probe client, ci.yml), not of this one.
**/*.Dockerfile
# Host-side container orchestration, never executed by the application image.
scripts/result-budget-image.sh
scripts/account-deletion-image.sh
# The procedures kept beside the scripts and suites they run are notes for
# whoever runs them; the application never reads them.
scripts/**/*.md
src/**/*.md
# The list of pages the documentation lint's writing rules skip is read by
# that lint alone.
scripts/docs-not-rewritten.txt
